🇷🇺🔹The Russian Ministry of Defense reported that the Russian Armed Forces have struck Ukrainian ports and ships involved in the delivery of cargo for the Ukrainian Armed Forces.

As a result of the strikes, the following were hit in the "Yuzhny" port in the Odessa region:

➡️A tanker that delivered fuel intended for the Ukrainian Armed Forces;

➡️Five fuel tanks for the Ukrainian Armed Forces located on the territory of a fuel storage complex;

➡️Ten storage facilities containing military equipment located on the territory of a logistics terminal;

➡️Port infrastructure facilities used for unloading and storing military cargo.

➡️The "Adzhalik" 330 kV substation, which provides power to the "Yuzhny" port

